## 🤝 Contributing

We welcome contributions! Please see [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md) for details.

### Development Setup

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/ai-se-os/ai-os.git
cd ai-os

# Set up development environment
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Run tests
pytest -v

# Run linting
ruff check .
```

